--- The runtime answers a misuse with its reason, never a crash
--- (docs/bug-classes.md §3). A recursion past 10000 calls stops both modes
--- with the same words: the interpreter had aborted at about 1500 calls,
--- on the main thread's stack, and the compiled program at Rust's own
--- limit. A tensor indexed by indices inside it, and tensors that join,
--- are what they were (the kernels had asserted the other cases).
use math
fn down[n]
    if n eq 0
        return 0
    return 1 + down[n - 1]
log[down[9000]]
a = linspace[10, 50, 5]
log[a[linspace[0, 2, 3]]]
log[concat[ones[2], ones[1]]]
log[down[20000]]
log['not reached']
